":"response, a 5xx, 408 or 429, and drops one it rejects. A record sent again keeps its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"uuid"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The bytes are the same for the same records on every run and platform: no whitespace, object","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"members in the order of their names’ UTF-8 bytes. PostHog takes a body of up to 20 MB, so keep","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"batches far smaller (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch()"},{"text":" sends 20 records at most).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding\/PostHogBatchEncoder"},"references":{"doc://PostHogEncoding/documentation/PostHogEncoding":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding","title":"PostHogEncoding","abstract":[{"text":"Write batches of records for PostHog’s batch capture API, for an ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to send.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/posthogencoding","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Sensitive":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","url":"\/documentation\/events\/sensitive","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sensitive"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sensitive"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Sensitive","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property value that a destination reads only through the record it arrived in, and not at all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once the record is redacted."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://PostHogEncoding/documentation/PostHogEncoding/PostHogBatch":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A batch as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference